# What never goes into a packaged chart.
#
# `ci/` is excluded deliberately: those files are render fixtures for the tests
# in this repository, and one of them carries a placeholder image digest that
# resolves to nothing. Shipping them inside a package would put a values file
# that cannot install next to one that can.
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
.bzr/
.hg/
.svn/
*.swp
*.tmp
*.orig
*~
.project
.idea/
*.tmproj
.vscode/
ci/
